## Alphabet
built | pass | fail | blocked | deadline | user_stop

## Event rules            <!-- first matching rule, top to bottom, yields the token -->
- `date +%s` ≥ deadline → deadline            (preempts everything)
- user says stop → user_stop                  (preempts everything)
- any measurement returned FAIL → fail
- every measurement under test returned PASS → pass
- any unit returned blocked, or a claimed commit is not in git log → blocked
- every dispatched unit returned done with its commit in git log → built

## States
### <INITIAL>        [initial]
- Entry effects: <dispatch … | write … | check …>
### …
### SHIP             [final]
- Output: <commit hash | path | verdict>
### ESCALATE         [final]
- Output: the missed (state, event) pair or the exhausted cycle

